      "id": "cycle",
      "title": "One dimer, 1 to 4",
      "caption": "Composite: one 8.2 nm dimer step via a one-head-bound ATP-waiting pathway. Head states (H1/H2), panels 1–4: ADP·Pi/apo, ADP/apo, ADP/ATP, apo/ADP·Pi; apo means no nucleotide. AMP-PNP stands in for ATP and ADP·Pi. Free-head and coil positions are illustrative; pale linkers and the stalk stub are modelled, and the stalk runs about 60 nm on to the cargo.",
